usage: wrkslots adopt [-h] --agent AGENT --owner-pid PID --expected-generation N slot

Bind the exact live process generation that will own a newly created slot. This is only valid for a slot created without --owner-pid and does not transfer an existing owner.

positional arguments:
  slot                     active slot awaiting an owner

options:
  -h, --help               show this help message and exit
  --agent AGENT            agent name already recorded on the slot
  --owner-pid PID          live owner PID to bind
  --expected-generation N  current slot generation; refuses stale callers
